    "status": "present",
    "value": "rules are ordered [action, target] with action ALLOW or DENY and target either a dotted IPv4 address (exact match) or base/k (CIDR, 0 <= k <= 32; host bits of base are ignored). isAllowed(ip) applies the first rule whose target covers ip: true for ALLOW, false for DENY. If no rule matches the answer is false (default deny)."
  },
